      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Prefix Sum",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Prefix Sum",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "QvifMBQ8ytd-iTOKBq9BU",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 2492.6031746031713,
      "y": 386.68253968253975,
      "width": 385.55555555555543,
      "height": 268.88888888888897,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aW",
      "roundness": {
        "type": 3
      },
      "seed": 1885903948,
      "version": 399,
      "versionNonce": 2141385460,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "LcwlUCxtYtdxHKdSHkiCD"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1795659548695,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false
    },
    {
      "id": "LcwlUCxtYtdxHKdSHkiCD",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2501.7211013067304,
      "y": 396.1269841269842,
      "width": 367.3197021484375,
      "height": 250,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aX",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1277637324,
      "version": 363,
      "versionNonce": 305165428,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1795659548695,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Store the running total from the\nstart of the array. The sum of any\ncontiguous chunk is then one total\nminus another: prefix at right plus 1,\nminus prefix at left. Build it once in\nO(n), then every query costs O(1).\nTip: pad the front with a zero,\nmeaning the empty prefix, so you\nnever need a special case when left is\n0.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "QvifMBQ8ytd-iTOKBq9BU",
      "originalText": "Store the running total from the start of the array. The sum of any contiguous chunk is then one total minus another: prefix at right plus 1, minus prefix at left. Build it once in O(n), then every query costs O(1). Tip: pad the front with a zero, meaning the empty prefix, so you never need a special case when left is 0.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "ZGquTl0ip5zQgLAidCx2N",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 2074.269841269838,
      "y": 753.1111111111112,
      "width": 545.5555555555555,
      "height": 331.6666666666667,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aY",
      "roundness": {
        "type": 3
      },
      "seed": 684069324,
      "version": 304,
      "versionNonce": 1251067380,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "bnCnNZxpLaHApwH2-wFQa"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1795659548695,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false
    },
    {
      "id": "bnCnNZxpLaHApwH2-wFQa",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2086.3378412155844,
      "y": 806.4444444444446,
      "width": 521.4195556640625,
      "height": 225,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aZ",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1669236172,
      "version": 304,
      "versionNonce": 1573709684,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1795659548695,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Sliding window keeps one live window. It slides across\nthe array, and you only care about the window right\nnow, so old sums are thrown away. Prefix sum has no\nwindow at all. You never move edges. You store the\nrunning totals once, and then any chunk, or all the\nchunks, is just a subtraction between two stored\ntotals. That's why it handles many windows at once,\nlike counting every subarray that adds up to K, and\nwhy negatives don't break it.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "ZGquTl0ip5zQgLAidCx2N",
      "originalText": "Sliding window keeps one live window. It slides across the array, and you only care about the window right now, so old sums are thrown away. Prefix sum has no window at all. You never move edges. You store the running totals once, and then any chunk, or all the chunks, is just a subtraction between two stored totals. That's why it handles many windows at once, like counting every subarray that adds up to K, and why negatives don't break it.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    }
  ],
